# GitHub reads this for its "Cite this repository" button, and Zenodo when it archives a
# release. Software indexes read codemeta.json; citesync checks that it agrees with this file.
# Check the name split below: the first word becomes the given name.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "sourceledger"
abstract: "Fetch or record the public files a dataset is built from, with a provenance record for every file"
authors:
